  "body": "Current preparation: **71154c1dc4661e7bfa30e89d8b434a9394f2feaa**.\n\nCI42512680372 on parent7df7f092 failed the Cortex-A72 allocation test: throughput::hash(16384) reported892bytes with the process-wide meter. Duplicate42512634770 passed. Both records remain. This child backports the reviewed calling-thread meter and4096-byte positive control; its entire meter/control prefix matches a930b4c1.\n\n163 release tests and20doc examples pass. The corrected-meter mutation check catches all5selected faults in15seconds. CI42513375083 is running on changed source. Production code remains7df7f092's, covered by Mac2032; Mac2030 covers the identical meter. Further native repeats would check unchanged code. Next-source cost tables remain separate from main-source acceptance.\n\nThe released ring correction (#303), exact main-source costs and AC-powered native acceptance remain open. Main, release versions, tags and artifacts are unchanged.\n\n\u2014 John Servil\n",
